From: Firmware Maintainers <firmware@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] web: recover expired initial setup sessions and explain failures

Refresh bootstrap state and credentials after a rejected setup session, return
operators to login, and retain phase reconciliation when setup has advanced.
Use allowlisted localized messages instead of blaming credentials for every
failure. Cover expiry, failed refresh, clock steps and safe public errors.

Upstream-Status: Pending

